This product includes software and methods developed by third parties:

* src/analysis/pwcca.py — Projection-Weighted CCA, adapted from
  google/svcca (https://github.com/google/svcca), Apache License 2.0.
  The original copyright header is preserved in that file.

* src/data/word_pairs.py — the synonym / near-homophone word-pair probing
  methodology follows:
    Minsu Choi et al., "Self-Supervised Speech Representations are More
    Phonetic than Semantic," Interspeech 2024.
    (reference implementation: github.com/juice500ml/phonetic_semantic_probing,
    Apache License 2.0)

* src/vtd/ — vocal-tract-distance extraction operates on articulator contours
  produced by the USC SPAN real-time MRI segmentation toolbox; the rtMRI
  75-Speaker corpus is distributed separately under its own data-use agreement.

